	<!-- Audio channel-count labels (shared by ListItem, MusicPlayer, VideoPlayer and the
	     per-stream AudioChannels.N properties). Modeled on Kodi's DefaultLayout table
	     (StreamUtils::GetDefaultLayout), but honest: a channel count cannot distinguish
	     layouts that share it, so ambiguous entries carry every layout the count may
	     represent. Unmapped counts display as the raw number. -->
